              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is good with leftover baked beans or even leftover chili. This also works with kielbasa or smoked sausage. Great quick lunch. This is one of the first things I make for lunch next day following a big barbeque or the day after making a big pot of chili. My husband loves this for breakfast, adding eggs to the rollup!"
